  "limitations": [
    "Complete original Plaza Hotel New York exterior reconstructed from two actually inspected ordinary elevated photographs,exact retained OSM/Q1066676 outline and standard viewer PMTiles/global terrain. No downloaded mesh,private photo texture,bespoke survey or archival research. Adjacent church,interiors,furnishings,street furniture,flags and surrounding city are excluded.",
    "Signed+X/ESE main entry faces Fifth Avenue/Grand Army Plaza;-Z/NNE long facade faces Central Park South. Exact stepped89.551x64.666m whole outline controls the ground mass.76m retained total differs from generalized85m mapped height;55.5m cornice,72.5m mansard and75.9m finials are photo-proportional reconstruction,not a certified as-built height schedule. Original roof/bay/dormer/floor inventory and western/southern details are approximate.",
    "Detailed master retains punched-window frames/recess returns,sills,molded cornices,upper balconies,rusticated lower bands,rounded eastern corner bays and ribbed domed caps,paired gables,steep green mansard with two dormer rows,inset skylight strips,visible shallow roofwell/plant,primary canopy/recessed vestibule and secondary north canopy. Far tiers aggregate facade,roof ornaments and openings while preserving the stepped whole mass and recognizable roof silhouette.",
    "Five existing256px graphs provide limestone,slate approximation of green patterned roof,painted-metal patina,window grid and granite foundation. Named stone and trim share one graph;no private or embedded images. Green roof material/color is a stylized catalog approximation,not a forensic identification. Shared glass is opaque patterned glazing with no optical interiors. Portable fallback differs from shared viewer binding. Detailed source remains separate from four browser tiers.",
    "Unmodified129x129/1.5m field oversamples two ordinary global terrain tiles.16m base is rounded from its center;urban returns across the building are roughly15–16m. Foundation skirt embeds below that field and entrance stairs sample it. Original curb/foundation/accessible-entry gradients are unsurveyed. Estimated tier errors3/1.5/.7/.25m are approximate,not certified mesh distances. Physical laptop/phone and dense-city timing remain unmeasured."
